OL,5,G2000 999 Rescue Squad
OL,6,     F08: A doctor on his way home from
OL,7,     Fwork is left fighting for his life
OL,8,     Fafter a head-on collision with a
OL,9,     Ftruck. Leeds paramedic Chris is
OL,10,     Fcalled to a motorcyclist who has
OL,11,     Fbeen hit by a taxi.
OL,12,G2100 999 Rescue Squad
OL,13,     FA student climber plunges from a
OL,14,     Fcliff face in Wharfedale and the
OL,15,     Fteam fears he has broken his neck.
OL,16,     FThe medics are also called to
OL,17,     Ftreat the victim of a stabbing at
OL,18,     Fa meat plant.
